  - code: item_desc_100
    en: Draw 1 random action card into your hand.
    pt_BR: "Pega 1 carta de a\xE7\xE3o aleat\xF3ria para a m\xE3o."
    zh_CN: "\u5C061\u5F20\u968F\u673A\u7684\u884C\u52A8\u724C\u52A0\u5165\u624B\u724C\u3002"
