  - code: item_desc_103
    en: Choose 1 card from the discard pile and add it to your hand.
    pt_BR: "Escolha 1 carta da pilha de descarte e adicione \xE0 sua m\xE3o."
    zh_CN: "\u4ECE\u5F03\u724C\u5806\u4E2D\u9009\u62E91\u5F20\u724C\u52A0\u5165\u624B\u724C\u3002"
