  - code: item_desc_170
    en: Gain 3 strength this combat and take 1 damage 3 times.
    pt_BR: "Ganhe 3 de for\xE7a neste combate e receba 1 de dano 3 vezes."
    zh_CN: "\u672C\u573A\u6218\u6597\u83B7\u5F973\u70B9\u529B\u91CF\u5E76\u53D7\u52303\u6B211\u70B9\u4F24\u5BB3\u3002"
    zh_TW: "\u672C\u5834\u6230\u9B25\u7372\u5F973\u9EDE\u529B\u91CF\u4E26\u53D7\u52303\u6B211\u9EDE\u50B7\u5BB3\u3002"
    nl: Krijg 3 kracht dit gevecht en ontvang 3 keer 1 schade.
    eo: "Akiru 3 forton \u0109i-batale kaj ricevu 1 dama\u011Don 3-foje."
    fi: "Saat 3 voimaa t\xE4ss\xE4 taistelussa ja otat 1 vahinkoa 3 kertaa."
    fr: "Gagne 3 force ce combat et re\xE7ois 1 d\xE9g\xE2t 3 fois."
    de: "Erhalte 3 St\xE4rke in diesem Kampf und erleide 3-mal 1 Schaden."
    id: Dapatkan 3 kekuatan dalam pertarungan ini dan terima 1 kerusakan 3 kali.
    it: Ottieni 3 forza in questo combattimento e subisci 1 danno 3 volte.
    ja: "\u3053\u306E\u6226\u95D8\u4E2D\u306B\u529B\u30923\u5F97\u30661\u30C0\u30E1\u30FC\u30B8\u30923\u56DE\u53D7\u3051\u308B\u3002"
    ko: "\uC774\uBC88 \uC804\uD22C\uC5D0\uC11C \uD798\uC744 3 \uC5BB\uACE0 \uD53C\uD574\uB97C
      1\uC529 3\uBC88 \uBC1B\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
