  - code: item_desc_204
    en: Draw 1 random Action/Power/Move card into your hand.
    pt_BR: "Pega 1 carta aleat\xF3ria de A\xE7\xE3o/Poder/Movimento para a m\xE3o."
    zh_CN: "\u5C061\u5F20\u968F\u673A\u7684\u884C\u52A8/\u5F3A\u529B/\u79FB\u52A8\u724C\u52A0\u5165\u624B\u724C\u3002"
    zh_TW: "\u5C071\u5F35\u96A8\u6A5F\u7684\u884C\u52D5/\u5F37\u529B/\u79FB\u52D5\u724C\u52A0\u5165\u624B\u724C\u3002"
    nl: Trek 1 willekeurige Actie/Kracht/Beweging-kaart in je hand.
    eo: Prenu 1 hazardan Agan/Potencan/Movan karton al via mano.
    fi: "Nosta 1 satunnainen Toiminta/Voima/Liike-kortti k\xE4teen."
    fr: "Pioche 1 carte Action/Pouvoir/Mouvement al\xE9atoire dans ta main."
    de: "Ziehe 1 zuf\xE4llige Aktions-/Kraft-/Bewegungskarte auf die Hand."
    id: Ambil 1 kartu Aksi/Kekuatan/Gerak acak ke tangan.
    it: Pesca 1 carta Azione/Potere/Movimento casuale in mano.
    ja: "\u30E9\u30F3\u30C0\u30E0\u306A\u30A2\u30AF\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3/\u30D1\u30EF\u30FC/\u79FB\u52D5\u30AB\u30FC\u30C91\u679A\u3092\u624B\u672D\u306B\u52A0\u3048\u308B\u3002"
    ko: "\uBB34\uC791\uC704 \uC561\uC158 \uD30C\uC6CC \uC774\uB3D9 \uCE74\uB4DC\uD55C\uC7A5\uC744
