  - code: item_desc_205
    en: Fill empty potion slots with random potions.
    pt_BR: "Preenche slots vazios com po\xE7\xF5es aleat\xF3rias."
    zh_CN: "\u7528\u968F\u673A\u836F\u6C34\u586B\u6EE1\u7A7A\u836F\u6C34\u69FD\u3002"
    zh_TW: "\u7528\u96A8\u6A5F\u85E5\u6C34\u586B\u6EFF\u7A7A\u85E5\u6C34\u69FD\u3002"
    nl: Vul lege drankjessleuven met willekeurige drankjes.
    eo: Plenigu malplenajn poci-ujojn per hazardaj pocioj.
    fi: "T\xE4yt\xE4 tyhj\xE4t juomapaikat satunnaisilla juomilla."
    fr: "Remplis les emplacements vides avec des potions al\xE9atoires."
    de: "F\xFClle leere Trankslots mit zuf\xE4lligen Tr\xE4nken."
    id: Isi slot ramuan kosong dengan ramuan acak.
    it: Riempi gli slot vuoti con pozioni casuali.
    ja: "\u7A7A\u306E\u30DD\u30FC\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u30B9\u30ED\u30C3\u30C8\u3092\u30E9\u30F3\u30C0\u30E0\u306A\u30DD\u30FC\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3067\u57CB\u3081\u308B\u3002"
    ko: "\uBE48 \uD3EC\uC158 \uC2AC\uB86F\uC744 \uBB34\uC791\uC704 \uD3EC\uC158\uC73C\uB85C
