  - code: item_desc_206
    en: Use the top 3 cards from the draw pile.\n Targets are random.
    pt_BR: "Usa as 3 cartas do topo da pilha de compra.\\n Alvos aleat\xF3rios."
    zh_CN: "\u4F7F\u7528\u62BD\u724C\u5806\u9876\u90E8\u76843\u5F20\u724C\u3002\\n
      \u76EE\u6807\u968F\u673A\u3002"
    zh_TW: "\u4F7F\u7528\u62BD\u724C\u5806\u9802\u90E8\u76843\u5F35\u724C\u3002\\n
      \u76EE\u6A19\u96A8\u6A5F\u3002"
    nl: Gebruik de bovenste 3 kaarten van de trekstapel.\n Doelen willekeurig.
    eo: Uzu la suprajn 3 kartojn de la prenstako.\n Celoj estas hazardaj.
    fi: "K\xE4yt\xE4 nostopakan 3 ylint\xE4 korttia.\\n Kohteet ovat satunnaisia."
    fr: "Utilise les 3 cartes du dessus de la pile de pioche.\\n Les cibles sont
      al\xE9atoires."
    de: "Spiele die obersten 3 Karten des Nachziehstapels.\\n Ziele sind zuf\xE4llig."
    id: Pakai 3 kartu teratas dari tumpukan tarik.\n Target acak.
    it: Usa le 3 carte in cima alla pila di pesca.\n I bersagli sono casuali.
    ja: "\u5C71\u672D\u306E\u4E0A\u304B\u30893\u679A\u306E\u30AB\u30FC\u30C9\u3092\u4F7F\u7528\u3059\u308B\u3002\\n
      \u5BFE\u8C61\u306F\u30E9\u30F3\u30C0\u30E0\u3002"
    ko: "\uBF51\uC744 \uCE74\uB4DC \uB354\uBBF8 \uC704\uC5D0\uC11C\uBD80\uD1303\uC7A5\uC758
      \uCE74\uB4DC\uB97C \uC0AC\uC6A9\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.\\n \uB300\uC0C1\uC740 \uBB34\uC791\uC704
      \uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
