  - code: item_desc_270
    en: Double your damage this turn. Damage taken is doubled.
    pt_BR: "Dobra seu dano neste turno. O dano recebido tamb\xE9m dobra."
    zh_CN: "\u672C\u56DE\u5408\u4F24\u5BB3\u7FFB\u500D\u3002 \u53D7\u5230\u7684\u4F24\u5BB3\u4E5F\u7FFB\u500D\u3002"
    zh_TW: "\u672C\u56DE\u5408\u50B7\u5BB3\u7FFB\u500D\u3002 \u53D7\u5230\u7684\u50B7\u5BB3\u4E5F\u7FFB\u500D\u3002"
    nl: Dubbelt je schade deze beurt. Ontvangen schade verdubbelt.
    eo: "Duobligu vian dama\u011Don \u0109i-vice. Ricevita dama\u011Do duobligas."
    fi: "Tuplaa vahinkosi t\xE4ll\xE4 vuorolla. Otettu vahinko kaksinkertaistuu."
    fr: "Double tes d\xE9g\xE2ts ce tour. Les d\xE9g\xE2ts subis sont doubl\xE9s."
    de: Verdoppelt deinen Schaden in diesem Zug. Erlittener Schaden verdoppelt sich.
    id: Gandakan kerusakanmu giliran ini. Kerusakan diterima juga digandakan.
    it: Raddoppia i tuoi danni in questo turno. Anche i danni subiti raddoppiano.
    ja: "\u3053\u306E\u30BF\u30FC\u30F3\u306E\u30C0\u30E1\u30FC\u30B8\u304C2\u500D\u306B\u306A\u308B\u3002
      \u53D7\u3051\u308B\u30C0\u30E1\u30FC\u30B8\u30822\u500D\u306B\u306A\u308B\u3002"
    ko: "\uC774\uBC88\uD134\uC758 \uB370\uBBF8\uC9C0\uB97C \uB450\uBC30 \uC99D\uAC00\uC2DC\uD0B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uBC1B\uB294\uD53C\uD574\uAC00 \uB450\uBC30\uAC00 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    pl: Double your damage this turn. Damage taken is doubled.
    ru: Double your damage this turn. Damage taken is doubled.
    sr: Double your damage this turn. Damage taken is doubled.
    sr_Latn: Double your damage this turn. Damage taken is doubled.
    es: Double your damage this turn. Damage taken is doubled.
