  - code: item_desc_280
    en: Deal 10 damage to all tiles.
    pt_BR: Causa 10 de dano em todos os ladrilhos.
    zh_CN: "\u5BF9\u6240\u6709\u683C\u5B50\u9020\u621010\u70B9\u4F24\u5BB3\u3002"
    zh_TW: "\u5C0D\u6240\u6709\u683C\u5B50\u9020\u621010\u9EDE\u50B7\u5BB3\u3002"
    nl: Doe 10 schade aan alle vakken.
    eo: "Faru 10 dama\u011Don al \u0109iuj kestoj."
    fi: Aiheuta 10 vahinkoa kaikkiin ruutuihin.
    fr: "Inflige 10 d\xE9g\xE2ts \xE0 toutes les cases."
    de: "F\xFCge allen Feldern 10 Schaden zu."
    id: Berikan 10 kerusakan ke semua ubin.
    it: Infligge 10 danni a tutte le caselle.
    ja: "\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u30BF\u30A4\u30EB\u306B10\u30C0\u30E1\u30FC\u30B8\u3092\u4E0E\u3048\u308B\u3002"
    ko: "\uBAA8\uB4E0 \uD0C0\uC77C\uC5D0 10 \uB300\uBBF8\uC9C0\uB97C \uC90D\uB2C8\uB2E4."
