  - code: item_desc_290
    en: Increase max HP of all allied units except yourself by 10.
    pt_BR: "Aumenta o HP m\xE1ximo de todas as unidades aliadas exceto voc\xEA em
      10."
    zh_CN: "\u9664\u81EA\u5DF1\u5916\u7684\u6240\u6709\u53CB\u65B9\u5355\u4F4D\u6700\u5927\u751F\u547D\u503C\u589E\u52A010\u3002"
    zh_TW: "\u9664\u81EA\u5DF1\u5916\u7684\u6240\u6709\u53CB\u65B9\u55AE\u4F4D\u6700\u5927\u751F\u547D\u503C\u589E\u52A010\u3002"
    nl: Verhoog max HP van alle bondgenoten behalve jezelf met 10.
    eo: "Pliigu maksimuman HP de \u0109iuj aliancanoj krom vi mem per 10."
    fi: "Lis\xE4\xE4 kaikkien liittolaisyksik\xF6iden maksimi HP:t\xE4 10:ll\xE4
      itse\xE4si lukuun ottamatta."
    fr: "Augmente les PV max de toutes les unit\xE9s alli\xE9es sauf toi de 10."
    de: "Erh\xF6ht die max LP aller verb\xFCndeten Einheiten au\xDFer dir um 10."
    id: Tambah HP maks semua unit sekutu kecuali diri sendiri sebesar 10.
    it: "Aumenta i PV massimi di tutte le unit\xE0 alleate tranne te di 10."
    ja: "\u81EA\u8EAB\u3092\u9664\u304F\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u5473\u65B9\u30E6\u30CB\u30C3\u30C8\u306E\u4F53\u529B\u309210\u5897\u52A0\u3055\u305B\u308B\u3002"
    ko: "\uC790\uC2E0\uC744 \uC81C\uC678\uD55C \uBAA8\uB4E0 \uC544\uAD70 \uC720\uB2DB\uC758
      \uCCB4\uB825\uC744 10 \uC99D\uAC00\uC2DC\uD0B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    pl: Increase max HP of all allied units except yourself by 10.
    ru: Increase max HP of all allied units except yourself by 10.
    sr: Increase max HP of all allied units except yourself by 10.
    sr_Latn: Increase max HP of all allied units except yourself by 10.
    es: Increase max HP of all allied units except yourself by 10.
    th: Increase max HP of all allied units except yourself by 10.
    tr: Increase max HP of all allied units except yourself by 10.
    uk: Increase max HP of all allied units except yourself by 10.
    vi: Increase max HP of all allied units except yourself by 10.
    description: "\uC544\uC774\uD15C - \uC784\uD50C\uB780\uD2B8 \uC124\uBA85"
